  "description": "A 3D viewport control for Avalonia with metallic-roughness PBR, glTF loading and triangle-accurate picking. One binary renders through Metal, Vulkan, OpenGL, WebGL 2 or the CPU, chosen at runtime from whatever the host platform offers — desktop, mobile and the browser. Freeware, commercial use included. Preview release: the API may change before 12.1.0 final.",
